00:05:03.800 --> 00:05:06.920
Some coverage anticipates scrutiny of internal discussions.

00:05:07.660 --> 00:05:11.800
Others note the volume may surface routine as well as notable exchanges.

00:05:11.800 --> 00:05:16.100
Broad disclosure serves public interest in ambassadorial vetting

00:05:16.100 --> 00:05:18.360
